  <div class="pulse-card" style="border-left:3px solid #ff4136"><div class="pulse-val" style="color:#ff4136" id="rubdub">—</div><div class="pulse-label">❤️ rub-DUB (RED) — right ventricle — DATA OUT</div></div>
